WEBVTT

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.920 line:0%
[Episode 32]

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:42.240 line:0%
I didn't plan on keeping

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.839 line:0%
you and Mrs. Shen here today.

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:45.750 line:0%
No need to be so nervous.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:49.960 line:0%
However, I must

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.200 line:0%
advise both of you.

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:54.640 line:0%
The criminals arrested by the Imperial Investigation Department

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:55.400 line:0%
aren't just anyone

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.400 line:0%
you can overturn a case for.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.880 line:0%
You'd better think carefully about

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.770 line:0%
what to listen to,

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.640 line:0%
what to report,

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:05.610 line:0%
and what's

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.160 line:0%
best left unsaid.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.250 line:0%
Don't bring trouble to yourselves

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:20.250 line:0%
and your families.

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:51.800 line:0%
[Imperial Investigation Department]

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:05.240 line:0%
What exactly does Lai Luozhi want?

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.560 line:0%
Don't you trust Sun Tan's words?

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:08.880 line:0%
Of course not.

00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.640 line:0%
It's just that the truth is so obvious

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.640 line:0%
and terrifying,

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.630 line:0%
truly shocking.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.810 line:0%
But as Lai Luozhi said,

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:18.920 line:0%
we only have speculations,

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.180 line:0%
no concrete evidence.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:21.600 line:0%
I'm afraid for now,

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.440 line:0%
we can't do anything about him.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.940 line:0%
Then what about Sun Tan's

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.440 line:0%
testimony?

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.940 line:0%
I will, of course, report it truthfully.

00:03:29.629 --> 00:03:30.430 line:0%
Xing,

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:31.760 line:0%
thank you.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.320 line:0%
Secretary Lu,

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:48.840 line:0%
you came to my place,

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.720 line:0%
yet didn't even bother to greet me,

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.050 line:0%
and now you're leaving?

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.240 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.420 line:0%
You seem suddenly afraid of me again.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.280 line:0%
You...

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.040 line:0%
Have you been

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.050 line:0%
arresting many officials lately?

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:07.840 line:0%
Yeah.

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.040 line:0%
Isn't that why

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.520 line:0%
you and that

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.160 line:0%
nosy friend of yours

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:13.720 line:0%
came here?

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.240 line:0%
What exactly are- are you trying to do?

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.240 line:0%
You're not planning to

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.500 line:0%
harm Yan Xing, are you?

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:25.770 line:0%
That's so unfair.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.000 line:0%
Didn't you say

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.200 line:0%
I was your friend too?

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:29.880 line:0%
Then why are you only worried

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.000 line:0%
that I might hurt her,

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.000 line:0%
but not concerned

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.520 line:0%
that she might sabotage my plans?

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.300 line:0%
I don't have a friend like you.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.520 line:0%
I'm warning you,

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.459 line:0%
you mustn't harm Yan Xing.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:42.560 line:0%
If anything

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:43.920 line:0%
happens to Yan Xing,

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.680 line:0%
I will never forgive you!

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.670 line:0%
Well, we'll have to see

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.260 line:0%
what she's really up to then.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.240 line:0%
Aren't you working at the Ministry of Justice?

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.520 line:0%
Why did you go to the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.600 line:0%
and even presented a dossier

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:09.960 line:0%
to Madam Xu in the palace?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.240 line:0%
You're still having people from the Imperial Security Bureau

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.080 line:0%
watch me?

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.080 line:0%
Do you know

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:20.960 line:0%
that the moment

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.200 line:0%
you stepped out of the Imperial Investigation Department

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.130 line:0%
with Sun Tan's testimony today,

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:26.240 line:0%
your head was

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:27.970 line:0%
no longer on your shoulders?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.960 line:0%
But Sun Tan suspects

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.360 line:0%
that Lai Luozhi wants to control

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.540 line:0%
the Gannan fortress,

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.890 line:0%
and even collude with foreign tribes for ill intent.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.280 line:0%
Shouldn't such important information

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.080 line:0%
be reported to Her Majesty?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.360 line:0%
And

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.740 line:0%
don't you want to help Sun Tan too?

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.480 line:0%
Sun Tan has been

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:46.340 line:0%
very helpful to us in Gannan Area.

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:48.380 line:0%
Of course I want to help him.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.730 line:0%
But I don't want you to be in danger.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.560 line:0%
I know your personality.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.120 line:0%
I'm not trying to stop you from investigating,

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.600 line:0%
but in the future,

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.480 line:0%
you can't be so reckless.

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.360 line:0%
Next time you encounter something,

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.600 line:0%
don't forget that your husband

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.730 line:0%
is the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.360 line:0%
I'm just afraid of causing you trouble.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.530 line:0%
If I were afraid of trouble,

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.080 line:0%
how would I dare to marry you?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.360 line:0%
Honey,

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:01.880 line:0%
what do you think Her Majesty

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.500 line:0%
will decide after reading

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:04.790 line:0%
Sun Tan's testimony?

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.280 line:0%
I don't know.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:11.120 line:0%
What I did today

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:14.170 line:0%
truly angered Lai Luozhi.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.910 line:0%
I didn't even know

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:20.110 line:0%
if I'm really helping Sun Tan

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:22.630 line:0%
or harming him.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.150 line:0%
Be true to your heart;

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.900 line:0%
don't worry about the future.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.280 line:0%
Since you've conspired with Yan Xing and Xu Xiangren

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.400 line:0%
to accuse me,

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.120 line:0%
you surely know

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.640 line:0%
what kind of fate

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.720 line:0%
awaits you.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:19.800 line:0%
However,

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:21.920 line:0%
you also have a way to survive.

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:27.660 line:0%
As long as you write down

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.400 line:0%
a list of the bandits

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.800 line:0%
Xu Xiangren associated before he became

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:32.130 line:0%
the Constable Marshal,

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.709 line:0%
I promise

00:08:33.729 --> 00:08:36.270 line:0%
you can leave the Imperial Investigation Department alive.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.820 line:0%
You might even

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.510 line:0%
become the next Constable Marshal.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:44.060 line:0%
You want me to frame Commander Xu?

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.700 line:0%
This Xu Xiangren

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.170 line:0%
is really an eyesore.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.960 line:0%
Do you know how

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:58.920 line:0%
Xu Xiangren became

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.320 line:0%
the Constable Marshal?

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:06.080 line:0%
Back then, he made three deals

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.800 line:0%
with the current Grand Empress Dowager

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.170 line:0%
to steal treasures from the palace.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:13.360 line:0%
And he actually managed

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.960 line:0%
to snatch the palace treasures

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.800 line:0%
amidst intense security.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.740 line:0%
Her Majesty, valuing his talent,

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.080 line:0%
allowed him to

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.080 line:0%
take over General Yuan's position.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.090 line:0%
You?

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:31.160 line:0%
Against him?

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.680 line:0%
To deal with a tough rock,

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.760 line:0%
it depends on what you use to crack it.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.590 line:0%
You just need to provide the list.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.620 line:0%
As for the rest,

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:47.060 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department will handle it.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.060 line:0%
This is simple for you.

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.030 line:0%
It's not really betrayal,

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.050 line:0%
is it?

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.260 line:0%
Don't you want to be

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.800 line:0%
the Constable Marshal who commands all the constables

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.080 line:0%
in the world?

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.880 line:0%
I do.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.090 line:0%
I really do.

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.960 line:0%
I really want that

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:42.890 line:0%
token

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:45.410 line:0%
to command all the constables!

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:49.930 line:0%
I'm waiting for your list.

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:21.840 line:0%
What did you steal?

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.100 line:0%
None of your business!

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:38.720 line:0%
A thief also has principles.

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:39.280 line:0%
You stole something,

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:40.440 line:0%
and you did it in such a vicious way.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.160 line:0%
Today, I'll let you...

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:42.360 line:0%
Don't hit Brother Tan!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:43.320 line:0%
You guys leave quickly!

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.420 line:0%
-Don't hit Brother Tan!
-Don't hit Brother Tan.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.520 line:0%
We'll give you all our food.

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.520 line:0%
Go quickly!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:47.810 line:0%
He stole things,

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:48.880 line:0%
and brought them all to you?

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:50.040 line:0%
Brother Tan is a good person.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.160 line:0%
If it weren't for him,

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:51.880 line:0%
I would've starved to death.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:52.320 line:0%
Go quickly.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.040 line:0%
Don't hit him.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.170 line:0%
-Don't hit him.
-He's a good man.

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:55.450 line:0%
Yes, he's a good man.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.740 line:0%
Don't hit him!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.690 line:0%
Don't steal anymore.

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:02.870 line:0%
Come work for me.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.100 line:0%
Stop pretending to be good here.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.030 line:0%
Look at you,

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:10.460 line:0%
you don't even look rich.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.290 line:0%
Maybe you're even worse than me.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.660 line:0%
It's just that my skills aren't good enough now.

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:14.960 line:0%
Once I've honed my skills,

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.240 line:0%
I'll be able to steal anything from the palace.

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.040 line:0%
Alright.

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:19.200 line:0%
Just you wait.

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:20.320 line:0%
I'm going to

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:21.960 line:0%
steal treasures from the palace

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.120 line:0%
and show you all.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.440 line:0%
Be gentle.

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:38.940 line:0%
These...

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:41.440 line:0%
are all stolen from the palace by you?

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.880 line:0%
I've already promised the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:44.920 line:0%
From now on,

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:45.560 line:0%
I am

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.040 line:0%
the Constable Marshal commanding all the constables

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:47.920 line:0%
in the world.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.000 line:0%
If you're

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.520 line:0%
willing to follow me in the future,

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.720 line:0%
you'll all become constables.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.380 line:0%
I don't want to be a constable.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:54.600 line:0%
I want to be

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:56.510 line:0%
the Constable Marshal.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.080 line:0%
Right?

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:57.800 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:58.980 line:0%
You have ambition.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:00.320 line:0%
Then you need to find a way

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.440 line:0%
to defeat me first.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:03.590 line:0%
Get down.

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.740 line:0%
One day, when I become stronger,

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:13.720 line:0%
I will kill you.

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:22.880 line:0%
Alright.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.770 line:0%
Then I promise you this.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.130 line:0%
When I die some day,

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:31.230 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.260 line:0%
this Constable Marshal's token

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:32.620 line:0%
♫Grudges and debts, right and wrong♫

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:31.720 line:0%
will be yours.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.440 line:0%
Deal.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:35.570 line:0%
♫The past is shrouded in blood and tears♫

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:35.840 line:0%
I promise you.

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.400 line:0%
I'll follow you

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.200 line:0%
♫It's been a long time since we parted♫

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.280 line:0%
until the day you die.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.900 line:0%
♫Can't fully explain the true story♫

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.330 line:0%
♫Fate twists and turns♫

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:45.340 line:0%
I'm not dead yet.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:46.860 line:0%
This token

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:48.260 line:0%
♫Life and death, fortune and misfortune, always intertwined♫

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.120 line:0%
is still waiting for you to claim it.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.770 line:0%
♫Obsession is hard to dispel, retain the true and discard the false♫

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.610 line:0%
♫Let the wind blow♫

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.980 line:0%
But you're not dead yet.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.580 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.860 line:0%
How can I take what's yours?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.370 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:05.030 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:09.830 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.410 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.330 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:13.350 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:18.280 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:43.550 line:0%
[Without a great leader like Commander Xu, the world would be in chaos.]

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:58.920 line:0%
Xing,

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.520 line:0%
this is sent by the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:01.440 line:0%
It's for you.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:05.800 line:0%
I thought

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.400 line:0%
Lai Luozhi would cause you trouble.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.280 line:0%
Seeing that you're fine today,

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.200 line:0%
I feel relieved.

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.800 line:0%
[The criminal Sun Tan refused to confess and has committed suicide out of guilt.]

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:19.520 line:0%
Xing,

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.710 line:0%
what does this document say?

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.360 line:0%
[The criminal Sun Tan refused to confess and has committed suicide out of guilt.]

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:32.720 line:0%
[The criminal Sun Tan refused to confess and has committed suicide out of guilt.]

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:35.000 line:0%
Sun Tan committed suicide out of guilt.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:47.200 line:0%
He still died.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.230 line:0%
That bastard

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.490 line:0%
Lai Luozhi!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.430 line:0%
Xu,

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.670 line:0%
I caused Sun Tan's death.

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:07.120 line:0%
Commander Xu knew you'd think this way,

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:08.200 line:0%
so we rushed here as soon as

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.200 line:0%
we got the news.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:10.620 line:0%
What Sun Tan wanted to say

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:14.350 line:0%
has already been conveyed through your report.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:16.120 line:0%
He chose to end his life.

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:18.280 line:0%
Firstly, he wanted to protect

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:20.080 line:0%
the brothers in Gannan Area.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:22.680 line:0%
Secondly...

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:28.540 line:0%
He wanted to protect me.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.200 line:0%
Brother,

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.740 line:0%
may you rest in peace.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:18.909 line:0%
Xing,

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:22.960 line:0%
why did you drink?

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:24.629 line:0%
Come.

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:30.570 line:0%
Lift your foot.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.240 line:0%
Is it because of Sun Tan?

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.160 line:0%
Sun Tan was

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:55.760 line:0%
a brave real man.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.440 line:0%
I failed to protect him.

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:00.600 line:0%
Today, I intended to

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.530 line:0%
go to the palace to plead for him,

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.290 line:0%
but I was still too late.

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.750 line:0%
Sun Tan died too wrongfully.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:15.590 line:0%
Look at this.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.200 line:0%
A letter from Pan Chi.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.200 line:0%
Pan Chi.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.160 line:0%
At a time like this,

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.680 line:0%
why are you still being jealous?

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:25.540 line:0%
It's important.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.840 line:0%
It's about the old case of the Shen family.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:28.830 line:0%
Look.

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:30.760 line:0%
Pan Chi wrote granary fire

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:31.270 line:0%
[Granary fire
Accelerant technique]

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:31.940 line:0%
and accelerant technique.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:33.560 line:0%
This means that the granary fire,

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:34.860 line:0%
which led to the Shen family's conviction,

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:35.840 line:0%
was deliberately fueled

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.440 line:0%
by accelerant technique.

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:40.260 line:0%
But this pattern on the jade pendant...

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:44.520 line:0%
What about it?

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:47.560 line:0%
This is the pattern

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.760 line:0%
of the pendant given by the late emperor

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.440 line:0%
to the Zhou family during his wedding

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.300 line:0%
with the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:53.370 line:0%
The Zhou family?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.380 line:0%
Could Pan Chi be suggesting

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.650 line:0%
that fire

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:00.140 line:0%
was set by the Zhou family?

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:04.740 line:0%
The one who caused the death of

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:05.600 line:0%
the entire Shen family

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:07.080 line:0%
was never anyone else

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.590 line:0%
but Zhou Xu herself

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:09.980 line:0%
of the Zhou family.

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:15.740 line:0%
The accelerant technique is a secret method of the Fire Moth Sect.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:17.700 line:0%
How could it be related to the Zhou family?

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:18.400 line:0%
Xing,

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:25.020 line:0%
do you want to go back and rest?

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:25.540 line:0%
No.

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:27.360 line:0%
I promised to

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.760 line:0%
find the truth with you.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.280 line:0%
Now we've finally found

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.200 line:0%
a clue.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:33.660 line:0%
But how could it be the Zhou family?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:37.850 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:39.750 line:0%
here's the secret report sent from Gannan Area.

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:40.680 line:0%
It's

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.320 line:0%
the autopsy result of those

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.780 line:0%
Half-faced Ghost corpses in Gannan Area.

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:48.400 line:0%
The triangular needle marks,

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.300 line:0%
upon examination,

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:51.010 line:0%
reveal that the victims were poisoned with a slow-acting poison

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.610 line:0%
called "Ten-Day Reaper."

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:56.550 line:0%
As the name suggests,

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:57.210 line:0%
[Yuanniang had triangular needle marks on her body.]

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.000 line:0%
ten days after being poisoned,

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:58.980 line:0%
the reaper claims

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.170 line:0%
their lives.

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:01.640 line:0%
Xing.

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:02.580 line:0%
Xing.

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.810 line:0%
The deceased have triangular

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.540 line:0%
needle marks on their necks.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:08.610 line:0%
Yuanniang...

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:10.840 line:0%
Yuanniang had them too.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:12.600 line:0%
Shen Du, do you remember,

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.130 line:0%
the day of the state preceptor's memorial,

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:15.440 line:0%
when I was captured by you?

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:16.760 line:0%
I was actually investigating

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.330 line:0%
the Yuanniang case on the mountain.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.120 line:0%
The case was originally closed as a crime of passion,

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:20.760 line:0%
but when I was

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:21.720 line:0%
organizing the files,

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:22.670 line:0%
I discovered that,

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:23.920 line:0%
on Yuanniang's body,

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.250 line:0%
there were also triangular needle marks.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:28.610 line:0%
It indicates that Yuanniang

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:29.720 line:0%
was also likely poisoned by

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:30.850 line:0%
the Ten-Day Reaper.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.630 line:0%
Why would the Fire Moth Sect target her

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.620 line:0%
and use a slow-acting poison?

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:39.460 line:0%
An ordinary woman in the mountain

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:40.950 line:0%
being targeted

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.770 line:0%
and poisoned with a slow-acting poison—

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.030 line:0%
there's only one possibility.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:47.280 line:0%
She knew something

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:48.480 line:0%
she shouldn't have

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:49.610 line:0%
and was silenced.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.760 line:0%
Go investigate

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:52.440 line:0%
whether she had

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:53.640 line:0%
any special identity

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:55.120 line:0%
or any other secrets.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:57.320 line:0%
Yes.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:05.520 line:0%
It seems the granary was

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.980 line:0%
indeed empty back then.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.440 line:0%
Using the Fire Moth Sect's accelerant technique

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:10.640 line:0%
to burn the granary

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:12.840 line:0%
was to cover up

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:15.960 line:0%
the fact that the granary was already empty.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.320 line:0%
I'm afraid Lai Luozhi

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.580 line:0%
is involved in this matter.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:20.600 line:0%
As for the Zhou family...

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:21.360 line:0%
Xing,

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.100 line:0%
thank you.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.520 line:0%
It seems now

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:30.280 line:0%
that the forces behind the Shen family's

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.810 line:0%
wrongful accusation are deeply entrenched.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:35.970 line:0%
We can't be hasty now.

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:43.680 line:0%
Xing,

00:21:44.390 --> 00:21:45.510 line:0%
no matter what,

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:49.890 line:0%
I don't want anything to happen to you.

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:40.710 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:55.040 line:0%
What time is it?

00:22:56.950 --> 00:22:57.810 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:22:58.780 --> 00:22:59.950 line:0%
Today is a day off.

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:12.950 line:0%
You got drunk last night.

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:24.730 line:0%
Pan Chi's letter...

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:28.360 line:0%
It's very useful.

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:31.200 line:0%
The network behind

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.640 line:0%
the Shen family's case

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:34.620 line:0%
is about to reveal itself.

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.070 line:0%
Thank you.

00:23:43.950 --> 00:23:44.750 line:0%
Yuanniang.

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:46.160 line:0%
Ten-Day Reaper.

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:47.990 line:0%
Jing Lin has already investigated.

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:48.680 line:0%
She was not only

00:23:48.680 --> 00:23:50.450 line:0%
a farmer from the nearby mountains,

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:52.740 line:0%
but also in charge of cleaning the Ming Hall during her lifetime.

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:53.770 line:0%
Ming Hall?

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.640 line:0%
When the state preceptor was alive,

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:59.140 line:0%
he also lived in Ming Hall.

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:01.620 line:0%
But since the state preceptor passed away,

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:03.410 line:0%
all the people related to Ming Hall

00:24:03.410 --> 00:24:05.340 line:0%
have disappeared without a trace.

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:06.840 line:0%
Could all of this

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:09.240 line:0%
be related to the state preceptor's death?

00:24:10.750 --> 00:24:12.950 line:0%
Could it be that the state preceptor...

00:24:14.710 --> 00:24:15.520 line:0%
After the state preceptor made

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:16.960 line:0%
his last prophecy,

00:24:17.690 --> 00:24:19.050 line:0%
he passed away shortly.

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:21.800 line:0%
I've heard rumors

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:24.570 line:0%
that the state preceptor's last prophecy was

00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:26.430 line:0%
"The phoenix leads nine chicks; The world is at peace."

00:24:26.430 --> 00:24:27.550 line:0%
There's an unknown

00:24:27.580 --> 00:24:28.580 line:0%
second half to it.

00:24:29.420 --> 00:24:30.480 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:24:31.540 --> 00:24:33.140 line:0%
the state preceptor's death

00:24:33.400 --> 00:24:35.130 line:0%
might also be very suspicious.

00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:38.240 line:0%
Could it be that

00:24:39.160 --> 00:24:40.800 line:0%
the state preceptor's death,

00:24:40.800 --> 00:24:41.960 line:0%
Yuanniang's death,

00:24:42.420 --> 00:24:44.360 line:0%
and the disappearance of people related to Ming Hall

00:24:44.360 --> 00:24:46.220 line:0%
are all related to that prophecy?

00:24:55.680 --> 00:24:56.480 line:0%
Madam,

00:24:56.710 --> 00:24:58.640 line:0%
someone from the palace has come to deliver an imperial edict,

00:24:58.640 --> 00:24:59.880 line:0%
saying Her Majesty

00:24:59.880 --> 00:25:02.840 line:0%
has summoned you alone to the palace.

00:25:03.760 --> 00:25:04.920 line:0%
I'll go with you.

00:25:07.760 --> 00:25:08.680 line:0%
Her Majesty

00:25:08.680 --> 00:25:10.340 line:0%
has requested that I go alone.

00:25:12.380 --> 00:25:13.360 line:0%
Alright, Uncle Zhong,

00:25:13.360 --> 00:25:14.320 line:0%
I understand.

00:25:14.320 --> 00:25:15.840 line:0%
Please ask the messenger to wait a moment.

00:25:15.840 --> 00:25:17.200 line:0%
I'll get changed and head over right away.

00:25:17.200 --> 00:25:17.840 line:0%
Yes.

00:25:41.760 --> 00:25:43.090 line:0%
Wait for me to come back.

00:25:51.980 --> 00:25:53.400 line:0%
Be mindful of your actions,

00:25:53.400 --> 00:25:55.060 line:0%
and do not act impulsively.

00:25:55.940 --> 00:25:56.740 line:0%
Also,

00:25:58.080 --> 00:25:59.780 line:0%
do not mention anything

00:26:00.050 --> 00:26:01.250 line:0%
related to Sun Tan.

00:26:03.240 --> 00:26:05.660 line:0%
Do not bring up any news about Lai Luozhi.

00:26:08.200 --> 00:26:09.430 line:0%
Never mention the Shen family.

00:26:09.430 --> 00:26:10.400 line:0%
Alright,

00:26:11.560 --> 00:26:12.720 line:0%
I got it.

00:26:16.880 --> 00:26:17.600 line:0%
When did you

00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:19.040 line:0%
become so long-winded?

00:26:36.450 --> 00:26:37.410 line:0%
Madam Xu.

00:26:38.360 --> 00:26:40.090 line:0%
This isn't the way to the study.

00:26:41.900 --> 00:26:43.830 line:0%
We're not going to the study today.

00:26:44.320 --> 00:26:47.050 line:0%
Her Majesty is waiting for you in her bedchamber.

00:26:47.670 --> 00:26:49.350 line:0%
Bedchamber?

00:26:54.520 --> 00:26:55.480 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:26:57.850 --> 00:26:59.900 line:0%
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:27:00.640 --> 00:27:01.760 line:0%
Get up.

00:27:08.130 --> 00:27:09.410 line:0%
Emerald cakes.

00:27:10.170 --> 00:27:11.410 line:0%
This is my

00:27:11.440 --> 00:27:13.080 line:0%
favorite food.

00:27:13.380 --> 00:27:14.700 line:0%
I can't eat much now.

00:27:14.730 --> 00:27:16.290 line:0%
Eating just half a piece,

00:27:16.310 --> 00:27:17.950 line:0%
I'll be full for half a day.

00:27:18.320 --> 00:27:20.120 line:0%
I'm not like you young people.

00:27:21.080 --> 00:27:22.080 line:0%
Try some.

00:27:29.880 --> 00:27:31.000 line:0%
These emerald cakes

00:27:31.000 --> 00:27:32.160 line:0%
are extremely rare.

00:27:32.160 --> 00:27:32.640 line:0%
It's made with

00:27:32.640 --> 00:27:34.190 line:0%
rouge rice offered as tribute from the Western Regions,

00:27:34.190 --> 00:27:36.040 line:0%
which is sun-dried and ground into powder,

00:27:36.040 --> 00:27:37.970 line:0%
then mixed with lotus leaf powder.

00:27:38.010 --> 00:27:39.870 line:0%
The filling is even more complex.

00:27:39.960 --> 00:27:40.800 line:0%
Her Majesty

00:27:40.800 --> 00:27:42.840 line:0%
rarely rewards anyone with this delicacy.

00:27:42.840 --> 00:27:43.840 line:0%
Try it now,

00:27:44.040 --> 00:27:47.240 line:0%
and see how it differs from those made outside the palace.

00:27:54.640 --> 00:27:55.840 line:0%
It's actually salty.

00:27:56.130 --> 00:27:58.540 line:0%
So, whether it's these pastries

00:27:58.640 --> 00:27:59.480 line:0%
or people,

00:27:59.600 --> 00:28:01.160 line:0%
sometimes you can't see clearly

00:28:01.160 --> 00:28:02.520 line:0%
or might misjudge them

00:28:02.680 --> 00:28:04.080 line:0%
just by appearances.

00:28:05.640 --> 00:28:07.900 line:0%
You're always so clever with your words.

00:28:17.400 --> 00:28:18.360 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:28:20.880 --> 00:28:22.160 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:28:22.440 --> 00:28:24.120 line:0%
it will be the beginning of winter in a couple of days.

00:28:24.120 --> 00:28:25.650 line:0%
You must not catch a cold.

00:28:25.960 --> 00:28:26.840 line:0%
You all

00:28:26.860 --> 00:28:28.420 line:0%
think I'm old.

00:28:29.660 --> 00:28:30.680 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:28:30.680 --> 00:28:32.480 line:0%
you are a blessing to Cang State.

00:28:32.520 --> 00:28:34.040 line:0%
People all wish for your

00:28:34.040 --> 00:28:35.280 line:0%
longevity,

00:28:35.320 --> 00:28:37.120 line:0%
always blessing Cang State.

00:28:38.310 --> 00:28:39.520 line:0%
Yan Xing,

00:28:40.640 --> 00:28:42.480 line:0%
do you know why I summoned you

00:28:42.770 --> 00:28:44.250 line:0%
this time?

00:28:46.000 --> 00:28:47.530 line:0%
I do not know, Your Majesty.

00:28:49.040 --> 00:28:50.380 line:0%
There are some matters

00:28:51.800 --> 00:28:53.520 line:0%
I want to clarify.

00:28:54.440 --> 00:28:55.480 line:0%
Firstly,

00:28:55.960 --> 00:28:56.820 line:0%
I've heard that

00:28:57.160 --> 00:28:59.020 line:0%
the former prefectural governor of Yingzhou,

00:28:59.020 --> 00:29:01.520 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi, claimed before his death

00:29:01.660 --> 00:29:03.390 line:0%
that the Shen family's old case

00:29:04.140 --> 00:29:06.060 line:0%
was directed by me.

00:29:08.510 --> 00:29:10.160 line:0%
Shen Du is loyal

00:29:10.160 --> 00:29:11.160 line:0%
to Your Majesty,

00:29:11.260 --> 00:29:12.590 line:0%
and so am I.

00:29:16.520 --> 00:29:17.480 line:0%
Don't panic.

00:29:17.770 --> 00:29:19.370 line:0%
Get up and explain in detail.

00:29:25.230 --> 00:29:27.150 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi did say that,

00:29:27.620 --> 00:29:28.580 line:0%
but Shen Du

00:29:28.610 --> 00:29:30.530 line:0%
has served Your Majesty for many years;

00:29:30.530 --> 00:29:32.660 line:0%
how could he be deceived by a few words?

00:29:33.370 --> 00:29:34.280 line:0%
Moreover,

00:29:34.490 --> 00:29:35.450 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi

00:29:35.470 --> 00:29:37.100 line:0%
was also deceived by villains

00:29:37.100 --> 00:29:38.700 line:0%
to believe such statements.

00:29:39.070 --> 00:29:40.780 line:0%
In order to repay his teacher's kindness,

00:29:40.780 --> 00:29:42.270 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi has always had an obsession

00:29:42.270 --> 00:29:44.800 line:0%
to uncover the truth about the Shen family from years ago.

00:29:44.800 --> 00:29:46.040 line:0%
Therefore, he was lured

00:29:46.040 --> 00:29:47.220 line:0%
into the wrong path,

00:29:47.220 --> 00:29:49.150 line:0%
becoming an executioner for the Fire Moth Sect,

00:29:49.150 --> 00:29:50.470 line:0%
and made a big mistake.

00:29:52.730 --> 00:29:54.610 line:0%
As for the second matter,

00:29:54.630 --> 00:29:57.400 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect has been in Yingzhou for many years

00:29:57.400 --> 00:30:00.040 line:0%
without leaking even the slightest hint.

00:30:00.550 --> 00:30:02.280 line:0%
Does this Fire Moth Sect

00:30:02.400 --> 00:30:05.270 line:0%
have any other forces elsewhere?

00:30:05.920 --> 00:30:06.720 line:0%
Well...

00:30:10.150 --> 00:30:11.510 line:0%
I'm afraid they do.

00:30:12.080 --> 00:30:13.200 line:0%
But it is not known

00:30:13.200 --> 00:30:14.900 line:0%
what form they appear

00:30:15.280 --> 00:30:16.080 line:0%
in public.

00:30:17.600 --> 00:30:19.460 line:0%
The Yingzhou case is one example.

00:30:19.460 --> 00:30:21.250 line:0%
If one Mo Qianzhi falls,

00:30:21.580 --> 00:30:22.380 line:0%
will there be

00:30:22.510 --> 00:30:24.350 line:0%
more Mo Qianzhis emerging?

00:30:28.290 --> 00:30:30.660 line:0%
Your Majesty is diligent in governance and loves the people.

00:30:30.660 --> 00:30:32.410 line:0%
People live and work in peace and contentment.

00:30:32.410 --> 00:30:33.630 line:0%
There certainly won't be more

00:30:33.630 --> 00:30:34.820 line:0%
people like Mo Qianzhi

00:30:34.820 --> 00:30:35.660 line:0%
emerging.

00:30:36.480 --> 00:30:37.800 line:0%
Back then, when I

00:30:38.410 --> 00:30:40.520 line:0%
ascended to the throne with the young emperor,

00:30:40.520 --> 00:30:42.630 line:0%
I had to bear so much slander.

00:30:42.660 --> 00:30:44.060 line:0%
How many people can

00:30:44.080 --> 00:30:46.200 line:0%
truly understand my helplessness?

00:30:46.260 --> 00:30:47.200 line:0%
Everyone

00:30:47.200 --> 00:30:49.400 line:0%
wants to live comfortably.

00:30:49.680 --> 00:30:52.160 line:0%
But since I'm in this position,

00:30:53.360 --> 00:30:54.560 line:0%
I can only

00:30:54.580 --> 00:30:57.170 line:0%
bear the responsibilities of the position.

00:30:57.420 --> 00:31:00.020 line:0%
As the Grand Empress Dowager,

00:31:00.340 --> 00:31:02.670 line:0%
I know the road ahead is dim,

00:31:03.050 --> 00:31:04.690 line:0%
but I have never given up.

00:31:05.530 --> 00:31:06.920 line:0%
Qi'er is still young,

00:31:07.390 --> 00:31:09.490 line:0%
and I, a woman, am in charge.

00:31:10.410 --> 00:31:12.770 line:0%
How many men in the world are convinced?

00:31:13.720 --> 00:31:15.880 line:0%
But I must make them convinced!

00:31:21.090 --> 00:31:23.420 line:0%
These years have been relatively stable,

00:31:23.730 --> 00:31:25.860 line:0%
not failing the late emperor's trust.

00:31:27.260 --> 00:31:29.070 line:0%
Your Majesty's demeanor

00:31:29.140 --> 00:31:30.000 line:0%
is the model

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:31.530 line:0%
for all women in Cang State.

00:31:33.970 --> 00:31:35.450 line:0%
There's one more thing.

00:31:43.400 --> 00:31:45.640 line:0%
Regarding Sun Tan's death,

00:31:47.250 --> 00:31:49.430 line:0%
I know you

00:31:50.140 --> 00:31:54.100 line:0%
submitted the petition to the palace under pressure.

00:31:54.130 --> 00:31:55.120 line:0%
However, Sun Tan

00:31:55.120 --> 00:31:57.650 line:0%
still died under mysterious circumstances.

00:31:57.920 --> 00:31:59.520 line:0%
Do you think

00:31:59.790 --> 00:32:01.030 line:0%
that I

00:32:01.090 --> 00:32:04.580 line:0%
allowed Lai Luozhi to act recklessly?

00:32:07.340 --> 00:32:08.660 line:0%
Your Majesty

00:32:08.680 --> 00:32:11.080 line:0%
needs Lord Lai to supervise all officials,

00:32:11.530 --> 00:32:13.530 line:0%
requiring the overwhelming power.

00:32:14.030 --> 00:32:15.030 line:0%
But I know

00:32:15.270 --> 00:32:17.550 line:0%
no one is perfect and everyone makes mistakes.

00:32:17.550 --> 00:32:20.060 line:0%
If there's anything wrong in the case,

00:32:20.870 --> 00:32:22.600 line:0%
I'm willing to be the honest one

00:32:22.730 --> 00:32:23.930 line:0%
to correct mistakes.

00:32:28.200 --> 00:32:29.000 line:0%
Good.

00:32:30.020 --> 00:32:32.710 line:0%
So frank and honest.

00:32:33.150 --> 00:32:36.390 line:0%
Yan Xing, you're quite straightforward.

00:32:36.420 --> 00:32:37.620 line:0%
I like that.

00:32:41.660 --> 00:32:42.860 line:0%
Do you know

00:32:43.020 --> 00:32:44.220 line:0%
that Lai Luozhi

00:32:44.250 --> 00:32:46.010 line:0%
paid me a visit last night?

00:32:46.770 --> 00:32:49.380 line:0%
He spoke highly of your achievements.

00:32:49.620 --> 00:32:50.840 line:0%
He even asked me

00:32:50.840 --> 00:32:53.040 line:0%
to make good use of you.

00:32:55.160 --> 00:32:56.320 line:0%
I am truly honored.

00:32:56.560 --> 00:32:58.490 line:0%
I have no connection with Lord Lai,

00:32:58.720 --> 00:32:59.480 line:0%
and I don't know

00:32:59.480 --> 00:33:00.680 line:0%
why Lord Lai recommended

00:33:00.680 --> 00:33:01.680 line:0%
me.

00:33:02.280 --> 00:33:03.080 line:0%
I

00:33:03.340 --> 00:33:05.470 line:0%
don't want any rewards or promotions.

00:33:05.770 --> 00:33:07.390 line:0%
I just want to examine bodies and solve cases,

00:33:07.390 --> 00:33:08.670 line:0%
to uncover the truth

00:33:08.700 --> 00:33:10.630 line:0%
and bring justice to the deceased.

00:33:11.520 --> 00:33:13.450 line:0%
Alright, alright. Get up quickly.

00:33:13.520 --> 00:33:14.400 line:0%
How many times

00:33:14.400 --> 00:33:15.880 line:0%
have you knelt in this short while?

00:33:15.880 --> 00:33:16.740 line:0%
Get up quickly.

00:33:26.960 --> 00:33:27.520 line:0%
Come.

00:33:27.960 --> 00:33:28.760 line:0%
Come over.

00:33:29.690 --> 00:33:30.530 line:0%
Take this.

00:33:37.830 --> 00:33:39.120 line:0%
Looking at you

00:33:39.120 --> 00:33:41.600 line:0%
reminds me of my younger days.

00:33:42.460 --> 00:33:44.000 line:0%
Come to the palace more often

00:33:44.000 --> 00:33:46.560 line:0%
when you have time and keep me company.

00:33:46.560 --> 00:33:47.360 line:0%
Alright?

00:33:51.450 --> 00:33:53.010 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:34:02.560 --> 00:34:05.830 line:0%
[Zhaotai Palace]

00:34:09.380 --> 00:34:11.039 line:0%
Have you heard of Consort Shu?

00:34:13.499 --> 00:34:14.910 line:0%
The late emperor's

00:34:15.120 --> 00:34:16.810 line:0%
Consort Shu from Nanlang?

00:34:18.510 --> 00:34:19.600 line:0%
I've heard a little about her.

00:34:19.600 --> 00:34:20.959 line:0%
This place was once

00:34:20.979 --> 00:34:24.310 line:0%
the residence granted to Consort Shu by the late emperor.

00:34:25.990 --> 00:34:27.340 line:0%
There are rumors

00:34:27.070 --> 00:34:29.110 line:0%
[Zhaotai Palace]

00:34:27.760 --> 00:34:29.289 line:0%
that Consort Shu was killed

00:34:29.560 --> 00:34:31.030 line:0%
by the Grand Empress Dowager, who was then the Empress,

00:34:31.030 --> 00:34:32.640 line:0%
over a struggle for favor.

00:34:35.729 --> 00:34:38.550 line:0%
But in fact, Consort Shu died of melancholy,

00:34:38.680 --> 00:34:40.080 line:0%
missing her homeland.

00:34:40.720 --> 00:34:41.660 line:0%
It's just another

00:34:41.660 --> 00:34:43.400 line:0%
sad story of unfulfilled desire

00:34:43.400 --> 00:34:44.840 line:0%
in this palace.

00:35:11.420 --> 00:35:12.280 line:0%
Now that you have

00:35:12.280 --> 00:35:14.480 line:0%
a pass to come and go freely in the palace,

00:35:14.480 --> 00:35:16.010 line:0%
you should understand that

00:35:16.340 --> 00:35:18.170 line:0%
the emperor's favor is as deep as the sea

00:35:18.170 --> 00:35:20.030 line:0%
but also as heavy as a mountain.

00:35:22.210 --> 00:35:23.690 line:0%
I feel overwhelmed.

00:35:23.910 --> 00:35:25.710 line:0%
Please give me some guidance.

00:35:28.080 --> 00:35:29.240 line:0%
A few days ago, I helped submit

00:35:29.240 --> 00:35:30.720 line:0%
Sun Tan's testimony for you.

00:35:30.720 --> 00:35:32.890 line:0%
Her Majesty didn't express any opinion.

00:35:32.890 --> 00:35:33.840 line:0%
Then Lai Luozhi

00:35:33.840 --> 00:35:35.760 line:0%
deliberately praised you before Her Majesty.

00:35:35.760 --> 00:35:37.040 line:0%
Today, Her Majesty

00:35:37.040 --> 00:35:38.440 line:0%
specially invited you here,

00:35:38.440 --> 00:35:40.040 line:0%
giving you a chance to speak.

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:43.040 line:0%
You should understand that

00:35:43.040 --> 00:35:43.920 line:0%
Her Majesty has to

00:35:43.920 --> 00:35:45.800 line:0%
consider public opinion

00:35:46.260 --> 00:35:48.400 line:0%
and also ensure the loyalty of her subjects

00:35:48.400 --> 00:35:50.920 line:0%
in this male-dominated world.

00:35:51.840 --> 00:35:53.040 line:0%
I used to think that

00:35:53.320 --> 00:35:56.000 line:0%
everything in the world was either black or white,

00:35:56.000 --> 00:35:57.990 line:0%
but after experiencing so much,

00:35:58.120 --> 00:36:00.250 line:0%
I've come to understand a little more.

00:36:01.920 --> 00:36:04.160 line:0%
Her Majesty intends to show you favor.

00:36:04.320 --> 00:36:06.110 line:0%
Firstly, she genuinely values you,

00:36:06.110 --> 00:36:07.120 line:0%
and secondly,

00:36:07.160 --> 00:36:08.760 line:0%
it's also for Shen Du's sake.

00:36:09.190 --> 00:36:10.560 line:0%
You were married into the Shen family

00:36:10.560 --> 00:36:12.660 line:0%
through Minister Zhang's efforts.

00:36:12.230 --> 00:36:15.110 line:0%
[Zhaotai Palace]

00:36:12.720 --> 00:36:13.440 line:0%
Now,

00:36:13.440 --> 00:36:15.570 line:0%
Lai Luozhi also shows you great favor.

00:36:15.960 --> 00:36:17.640 line:0%
It's hard not to suspect

00:36:17.940 --> 00:36:19.650 line:0%
that you might be a spy

00:36:19.680 --> 00:36:21.520 line:0%
between both sides.

00:36:26.540 --> 00:36:30.140 line:0%
[Zhou]

00:36:56.490 --> 00:36:58.480 line:0%
I'm Yan Xing, the chief clerk of the Ministry of Justice.

00:36:58.480 --> 00:36:59.810 line:0%
Greetings, Lord Lai.

00:37:03.360 --> 00:37:05.630 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, you've been with Shen Du for so long.

00:37:05.630 --> 00:37:07.170 line:0%
I'm not sure about other things,

00:37:07.170 --> 00:37:09.410 line:0%
but your boldness has certainly grown.

00:37:10.560 --> 00:37:13.120 line:0%
I'm not sure what you mean by that.

00:37:13.210 --> 00:37:14.400 line:0%
Even the cases that the Minister of

00:37:14.400 --> 00:37:16.600 line:0%
the Court of Judicial Review avoids,

00:37:16.640 --> 00:37:17.960 line:0%
you dare to take the lead

00:37:17.960 --> 00:37:19.160 line:0%
in reviewing.

00:37:19.580 --> 00:37:21.240 line:0%
It must be because you have

00:37:21.260 --> 00:37:24.190 line:0%
the support of the Imperial Security Bureau, right?

00:37:24.520 --> 00:37:26.670 line:0%
And the constables, those bandits,

00:37:26.840 --> 00:37:28.570 line:0%
are also willing to help you.

00:37:29.080 --> 00:37:29.840 line:0%
But even if you

00:37:29.840 --> 00:37:31.080 line:0%
try everything you can,

00:37:31.080 --> 00:37:32.160 line:0%
the Sun Tan case

00:37:32.160 --> 00:37:34.040 line:0%
won't affect me at all.

00:37:34.740 --> 00:37:37.100 line:0%
You'd better see the situation clearly.

00:37:39.720 --> 00:37:41.780 line:0%
Thank you for the reminder, Lord Lai.

00:37:42.060 --> 00:37:45.110 line:0%
I don't have any great talents or strategies,

00:37:45.540 --> 00:37:47.140 line:0%
so naturally, I don't

00:37:47.170 --> 00:37:49.240 line:0%
consider things thoroughly.

00:37:50.270 --> 00:37:51.520 line:0%
Speaking of which,

00:37:52.330 --> 00:37:54.490 line:0%
your sister's truly admirable.

00:37:55.290 --> 00:37:56.810 line:0%
She excels in both civil and military affairs,

00:37:56.810 --> 00:37:58.140 line:0%
unmatched in the world.

00:38:00.280 --> 00:38:01.260 line:0%
Oh, by the way,

00:38:01.890 --> 00:38:03.300 line:0%
the other day when my husband and I

00:38:03.300 --> 00:38:05.700 line:0%
were strolling on the streets of Yingzhou,

00:38:05.740 --> 00:38:06.780 line:0%
my husband said

00:38:07.320 --> 00:38:09.250 line:0%
he seemed to have seen your sister.

00:38:14.080 --> 00:38:16.240 line:0%
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:18.460 line:0%
Recently, it's been cold.

00:38:18.460 --> 00:38:20.560 line:0%
My sister has been resting at home.

00:38:20.890 --> 00:38:21.960 line:0%
A few days ago,

00:38:22.120 --> 00:38:23.600 line:0%
she went out to play with the families

00:38:23.600 --> 00:38:24.760 line:0%
of several officials.

00:38:24.760 --> 00:38:26.760 line:0%
How could she have gone to Yingzhou?

00:38:28.340 --> 00:38:30.270 line:0%
If you're trying to frame someone,

00:38:30.320 --> 00:38:31.980 line:0%
you need evidence, don't you?

00:38:33.490 --> 00:38:35.400 line:0%
If Shen Du can't teach you properly,

00:38:35.400 --> 00:38:37.060 line:0%
why don't you come to my place?

00:38:37.510 --> 00:38:39.000 line:0%
I'll definitely...

00:38:41.100 --> 00:38:43.230 line:0%
teach you how to do things properly.

00:38:43.970 --> 00:38:44.770 line:0%
Is that so?

00:38:47.110 --> 00:38:48.770 line:0%
Then I wish your sister

00:38:48.800 --> 00:38:49.940 line:0%
good health, Lord Lai.

00:38:49.940 --> 00:38:51.140 line:0%
I take my leave now.

00:38:54.040 --> 00:38:55.100 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:38:56.180 --> 00:38:57.540 line:0%
Prince Xian

00:38:57.920 --> 00:39:00.810 line:0%
is hosting a banquet for officials on the Winter Solstice.

00:39:00.810 --> 00:39:02.150 line:0%
I assume the Shen's Mansion

00:39:02.150 --> 00:39:04.010 line:0%
has also received an invitation.

00:39:06.420 --> 00:39:07.560 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:39:08.400 --> 00:39:11.120 line:0%
I'll see you at the Prince Xian's Mansion then.

00:39:18.770 --> 00:39:21.410 line:0%
[Chengtian Gate]

00:39:33.080 --> 00:39:34.200 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:39:36.390 --> 00:39:39.260 line:0%
[Chengtian Gate]

00:39:55.360 --> 00:39:56.800 line:0%
Someone in the palace sent me a message

00:39:56.800 --> 00:39:58.360 line:0%
that Lai Luozhi intercepted you on the way.

00:39:58.360 --> 00:40:00.020 line:0%
I rushed over immediately.

00:40:00.240 --> 00:40:01.770 line:0%
Did he do anything to you?

00:40:13.800 --> 00:40:15.530 line:0%
Your ears are red from the cold.

00:40:20.740 --> 00:40:22.900 line:0%
You usually complain that carriage's too slow.

00:40:22.900 --> 00:40:24.760 line:0%
Why did you take a carriage today?

00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:25.800 line:0%
It's cold.

00:40:26.190 --> 00:40:27.920 line:0%
Riding a horse would be colder.

00:40:28.850 --> 00:40:30.430 line:0%
I didn't know

00:40:30.600 --> 00:40:32.060 line:0%
you were so thoughtful.

00:40:34.600 --> 00:40:37.130 line:0%
How was your audience with Her Majesty today?

00:40:39.190 --> 00:40:40.540 line:0%
[Zhou]

00:40:47.780 --> 00:40:49.380 line:0%
Her Majesty's private pass.

00:40:50.650 --> 00:40:52.680 line:0%
Madam Xu reminded me of something.

00:40:53.150 --> 00:40:54.750 line:0%
The Emperor's favor is as deep as the sea,

00:40:54.750 --> 00:40:56.480 line:0%
but also as heavy as a mountain.

00:40:58.290 --> 00:40:59.800 line:0%
If I'm not mistaken,

00:41:00.230 --> 00:41:02.000 line:0%
while Her Majesty asked the Imperial Security Bureau

00:41:02.000 --> 00:41:02.920 line:0%
to monitor the Imperial Investigation Department

00:41:02.920 --> 00:41:04.280 line:0%
and Lai Luozhi,

00:41:05.270 --> 00:41:06.950 line:0%
Lai Luozhi also received a secret order

00:41:06.950 --> 00:41:09.350 line:0%
to monitor my Imperial Security Bureau.

00:41:09.770 --> 00:41:11.260 line:0%
No wonder today

00:41:11.480 --> 00:41:12.080 line:0%
Lai Luozhi

00:41:12.080 --> 00:41:14.610 line:0%
deliberately waited for me at the palace gate

00:41:14.840 --> 00:41:16.040 line:0%
and even praised me

00:41:16.040 --> 00:41:17.370 line:0%
in front of Her Majesty.

00:41:17.640 --> 00:41:19.170 line:0%
He must have guessed it too.

00:41:21.450 --> 00:41:22.250 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:41:22.750 --> 00:41:24.520 line:0%
Will Lai Luozhi try to play tricks

00:41:24.520 --> 00:41:25.360 line:0%
at the banquet

00:41:25.360 --> 00:41:26.960 line:0%
in Prince Xian's Mansion?

00:41:30.120 --> 00:41:31.040 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:41:31.600 --> 00:41:32.920 line:0%
I will protect you.

00:41:38.640 --> 00:41:39.440 line:0%
Let's go.